### 校园模块测试

### 1. 用户登录
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 学生登录
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 获取校园结构
GET http://localhost:3000/campus/structure
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 4. 获取可用教室
GET http://localhost:3000/campus/available-rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 5. 获取可用体育设施
GET http://localhost:3000/campus/available-facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 6. 创建预约（学生）
POST http://localhost:3000/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "resourceType": "room",
  "useDate": "2025-05-26",
  "startPeriod": 1,
  "endPeriod": 2,
  "purpose": "exam",
  "attendeeCount": 30
}

### 7. 获取预约列表（学生）
GET http://localhost:3000/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 8. 获取预约列表（管理员）
GET http://localhost:3000/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 9. 获取待审核预约列表（管理员）
GET http://localhost:3000/reservations/pending/list
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 10. 审核预约（管理员）
PUT http://localhost:3000/reservations/1/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### 11. 拒绝预约（管理员）
PUT http://localhost:3000/reservations/1/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "rejected",
  "rejectReason": "时间冲突"
}

### 12. 创建保修申请
POST http://localhost:3000/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicant": "张三",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "description": "教室灯管坏了",
  "locationType": "room",
  "roomId": 1,
  "locationDetail": "教学楼A101教室"
}

### 13. 获取保修列表
GET http://localhost:3000/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 14. 获取待处理保修列表（管理员）
GET http://localhost:3000/maintenance/pending/list
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 15. 处理保修申请（管理员）
PUT http://localhost:3000/maintenance/1/handle
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "processing",
  "handleResult": "已安排维修人员"
}

### 16. 完成保修申请（管理员）
PUT http://localhost:3000/maintenance/1/handle
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed",
  "handleResult": "维修完成"
}

### 17. 取消预约（学生）
DELETE http://localhost:3000/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 18. 获取预约详情
GET http://localhost:3000/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 19. 获取保修详情
GET http://localhost:3000/maintenance/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}} 